{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Carimae All Unit Alerted. Tiesov invasion Has Been Confirmed. Code name &quot;RED DAWN,&quot; I Say Again. Code name &quot;RED DAWN&quot; Out.&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RED DAWN This game is an Anime Style Military SRPG game with a Cold War motif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the Baker Squad, the special forces of the Carimae School, to stop the invasion of Tiesov Force</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize, Training your Charactor And join the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various weapons!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/ad51ae9b3303877e69bd96eeca58efce.poster.avif?t=1770819052\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/ad51ae9b3303877e69bd96eeca58efce.webm?t=1770819052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/ad51ae9b3303877e69bd96eeca58efce.mp4?t=1770819052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> <br>RED DAWN has a variety of weapons, from small weapons such as pistols and machine pistols to heavy machine guns and anti-material sniper rifles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  However, each weapon has its own advantages and disadvantages, so it is best to prepare the appropriate weapon depending on the situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Many Wearable items!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/fda3e9a633dc06a88e0e79d06ef010a2.poster.avif?t=1770819052\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/fda3e9a633dc06a88e0e79d06ef010a2.webm?t=1770819052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/fda3e9a633dc06a88e0e79d06ef010a2.mp4?t=1770819052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get clothes, accessories, and hat items and customize your character! <br>Hundreds of items are available, including school uniforms, Chipao, glasses, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactics!!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/6c864323b87a485a9cfc065edbbae714.poster.avif?t=1770819052\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/6c864323b87a485a9cfc065edbbae714.webm?t=1770819052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/6c864323b87a485a9cfc065edbbae714.mp4?t=1770819052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flank and attack to neutralize the enemy's cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the cover to expose the enemy and make them easier to hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change weapon attachments!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/6cf28e8583efabb095c75a70a197b8ea.poster.avif?t=1770819052\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/6cf28e8583efabb095c75a70a197b8ea.webm?t=1770819052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/6cf28e8583efabb095c75a70a197b8ea.mp4?t=1770819052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upgrade your performance by attaching attachments to your firearm before you go into battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/251184b6756b4ef2f09515d5ad91dc7d.avif?t=1770819052\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras_big/251184b6756b4ef2f09515d5ad91dc7d.webp?t=1770819052 width=1560 height=766 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Carimae Private School and Tiesov Public School have long been famous for their bad relationship... <br>In September 1980, Tiesov invaded Carimae with an armored division.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story moves to the present, 1984.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Years have passed since Carimae and Tiesov began their war, but the front lines remain stalemate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > However, Carimae School's intelligence agency receives intelligence that Tiesov is creating a &quot;secret weapon&quot; to overturn the deadlocked front line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You must take command of the Baker Squad at Carimae Private School and stop the creation of a &quot;secret weapon&quot;.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2559960?t=1770819052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/4ef0df59ab9190c3a15e66e2529d008d2aeffb88/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770819052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/c79d8d9a9b39a739b40d1d9b25a4e75981c02bbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770819052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/c79d8d9a9b39a739b40d1d9b25a4e75981c02bbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770819052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2881330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Carimae All Unit Alerted. Tiesov invasion Has Been Confirmed. Code name &quot;RED DAWN,&quot; I Say Again. Code name &quot;RED DAWN&quot; Out.&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RED DAWN This game is an Anime Style Military SRPG game with a Cold War motif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the Baker Squad, the special forces of the Carimae School, to stop the invasion of Tiesov Force</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize, Training your Charactor And join the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various weapons!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559960/extras/ad51ae9b3303877e69bd96eeca58efce.poster.avif?t=1770819052\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse